help_contract:
  changed_file: crates/tq-cli/src/args.rs
  cause: Old help incorrectly called the process environment snapshot redaction-safe and obscured CLI ambient admission versus embedded capability controls.
  current_semantics: CLI enables environment/platform access; options admit those capabilities for embedded callers. Wording/test fix does not change runtime capability logic.
  regression: args::tests::help_distinguishes_cli_ambient_access_from_embedded_admission in crates/tq-cli/src/args.rs; passes latest macOS workspace and explicit Linux help regression, with release help captured.
  reconsideration: After help/parser/capability changes rerun wording regression and frozen release --help, plus embedded authority guards; do not infer redaction or policy changes from help text.
