macos_expected_scope:
  existing_user_acceptance: Existing scoped expected behaviors only; no fresh executable-bound approvals invented, no --completion rerun, no strict verdict changes.
  math[2]{id,input,jq,tq,delta}:
    manual.audit.math.erfc-ulp,2,0.0046777349810472645,0.004677734981047266,2 ULP higher
    manual.audit.math.tgamma-ulp,0.5,1.772453850905516,1.7724538509055159,1 ULP lower
  math_impact: Last-bit numeric and serialized-byte differences; two approved scoped expected semantics, not fresh executable-bound approvals or a blanket bound.
  math_cause: tq uses safe Rust libm::erfc/libm::tgamma in crates/tq-core/src/math.rs; pinned jq math implementation rounds these inputs differently. Do not attribute a static jq artifact solely to the current host libc.
  math_regression_file: tests/compatibility/cases/manual-math-boundaries.jsonl; exact erfc/tgamma witness IDs above remain mandatory strict observations.
  math_supporting_tests: crates/tq-core/tests/math_compat.rs all_registered_math_dispatches_execute_a_finite_witness; dispatch smoke is not itself a two-input ULP bound.
  color_contract: openspec/specs/output-colors/spec.md main contract; structural quote styling and SGR/reset boundaries intentional. Same plain JSON and process behavior; strict colored-byte mismatch retained.
  color_ids[6]: manual.colors.ansi-values,manual.colors.custom-1-31,manual.colors.default-palette,manual.invoking.color-output,manual.invoking.jq-colors,manual.invoking.no-color-forced
  color_regression_files[3]: tests/compatibility/cases/manual-colors.jsonl,tests/compatibility/cases/manual-invoking-jq.jsonl,crates/tq-cli/tests/output_colors.rs
  color_regression_tests[3]: default_palette_uses_tq_slots_for_json_scalars_and_keys,custom_eight_slot_palette_colors_quote_contexts_and_content_separately,every_native_output_format_strips_to_its_plain_bytes
  runner_id: manual.invoking.run-tests
  runner_cause: tq runs the supplied test without jq executable-internal self-test diagnostics; suffix difference is stdout presentation, not a failed supplied program.
  runner_regression_files[2]: tests/compatibility/cases/manual-invoking-jq.jsonl,crates/tq-cli/tests/extended_cli.rs
  runner_regression_test: run_tests_executes_stdin_test_files_and_reports_failures
  runner_impact: Both supplied tests pass and exit 0; jq internal compile-args/recompile/exhaust-reuse suffix omitted by tq, not supplied-program failure.
  regression_evidence: Latest newhelp-final/manual-full-final.json retains the same nine difference IDs and scoped math/color/runner observations; help observation changed, so no whole-report equality claim. Late-p2 and 20261006T071209Z/macos-nine-differences.json remain checkpoint evidence; all 303 protected exact contracts retained.
  reconsideration: After implementation or math-library/reference changes rerun these inputs and boundary witnesses; after presentation/runner changes rerun exact bytes and supplied-test status. Preserve the intentional output-colors contract unless separately changed; never infer blanket approval.
