  scale_conversion:
    observations: "jq [0,M,0,0,0] versus tq [M,M,0,2,2], M = maximum finite binary64."
    cause: Safe Rust conversion versus platform-dependent jq out-of-range C conversion; not ULP rounding.
  reconsideration: After full implementation or reference/library/platform fixes, reproduce each mapped target/input against pinned jq 1.8.2; retain exact raw outputs/status, classify causes and practical impact, rerun compact/TOON, composition and protected baseline. Fix or use a separate explicit reviewed-disparity decision before changing unresolved verdicts; no blanket normalization or acceptance from ownership alone.
